/// Show a picture in a box held before it arrives, with a caption where it needs one.
///
/// # Accessibility
///
/// The picture carries a real `alt`, always, and an empty one is a decision rather than an omission. A captioned image is a `<figure>` with a `<figcaption>`, so the line under it is attached to it.
